es! 학교 + 에"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I don't drink milk.", "sentence": "저는 우유 [ ? ] 안 마셔요.", "options": ["를", "을"], "answer": "를", "feedback": {"correct": "Yes! 우유 + 를"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "Minsu is at home now.", "sentence": "민수는 지금 집 [ ? ] 있어요.", "options": ["에", "을"], "answer": "에", "feedback": {"correct": "Yes! 집 + 에"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "I don't have time today.", "sentence": "저는 오늘 시간 [ ? ] 없어요.", "options": ["가", "이"], "answer": "이", "feedback": {"correct": "Yes! 시간 + 이"}}, {"type": "fill_blank", "instruction": "Yumi doesn't read books.", "sentence": "유미는 책을 [ ? ].", "options": ["안 읽어요", "읽어요 안"], "answer": "안 읽어요", "feedback": {"correct": "Yes! 안 + 읽어요"}}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #3", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"Yumi doesn't read books.\" 안 stays whole.", "contentObj": {"sentence": "유미는 책을 안 읽어요.", "translation": "Yumi doesn't read books.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["유미는"], "correct_turtle": ["유미는"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '유미는' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["책을"], "correct_turtle": ["책", "을"], "turtle_explanation": "'을' marks the object. After a vowel use 를, after a consonant use 을."}, {"id": "e3", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["안"], "correct_turtle": ["안"], "turtle_explanation": "'안' means 'not'. It goes right before the verb."}, {"id": "e4", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["읽어요"], "correct_turtle": ["읽어요"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '읽어요' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "유미는", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "를", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "읽어요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "책을", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "책", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "책를", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "을", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o